config/cdn.yaml contains rules derived from third-party sources:

- OWASP Core Rule Set (https://github.com/coreruleset/coreruleset)
  Copyright (c) OWASP CRS project and contributors. Licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
  Data lists and regular expressions were converted to AEM CDN traffic-filter syntax
  (case-insensitive matching, argument-boundary anchors, '+' treated as space).

- X4BNet lists_vpn (https://github.com/X4BNet/lists_vpn) – MIT License.

- Tor Project bulk exit list (https://check.torproject.org/torbulkexitlist), optional.
